          "formula": "\\nabla\\rho(u)=\\sqrt\\eta[\\nabla V(p+\\sqrt\\eta u)-\\nabla V(p)],\\quad D^2\\rho=\\eta D^2V,\\quad D^2Q=I+\\eta D^2V.",
